.TH SDL_GetJoystickPathForID 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetJoystickPathForID \- Get the implementation dependent path of a joystick.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_joystick.h>
.PP
.BI "const char * SDL_GetJoystickPathForID(SDL_JoystickID instance_id);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
This can be called before any joysticks are opened\[char46]

.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I instance_id
the joystick instance ID\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the path of the selected joystick\[char46] If no path can be found, this function returns NULL; call
.BR SDL_GetError ()
for more information\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this function from any thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

